WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Come to hands and knees with knees wider for the belly.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Slide one arm under, resting the shoulder softly.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Keep the other hand for light support.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Breathe, then press up.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Switch sides.
